<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse index little changed in thin trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse index little changed in thin trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index on Friday closed little changed in thin trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 559.76 from 559.39 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 265,757 dinars against 1.84 million dinars.</p>
<p>Chemical firm Al-Kimia  KIMI.TN was up 1.4 dinar to 40 dinars. ($=one dinar)</p>
</text>
